  "The whole piece",
  "Their listings are linked listings. Each names the shop and its button takes you to the shop's own website, where you buy under the shop's own price, terms and returns policy. eno has not vetted these shops and takes no payment for what you buy there.",
  "There is no checkout, no escrow and no buyer protection. The site holds no money: you pay the seller, or the source site, directly.",
